{"about_the_game":"The celebrated Mega Man X series returns! Play as Mega Man X \u2013 the powerful successor of classic fighting robot Mega Man \u2013 as he battles a variety of deadly bosses known as Mavericks in four unforgettable titles. Mega Man X Legacy Collection includes the legendary 16-bit titles and the series\u2019 exciting foray into the 32-bit era: Mega Man X, Mega Man X2, Mega Man X3, and Mega Man X4. The heroic robot grows stronger as he takes down Mavericks and steals their weapons, and can dash and wall jump making for a thrilling, fast-paced combat experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMega Man X Legacy Collection comes with an armory of new features. Test your skills in the new X Challenge mode, which pits players against two deadly bosses in two-on-one battles. Explore a huge museum filled with rare production art, catalogs of classic merchandise, a playlist of nostalgic commercials, and more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis collection is the ultimate way to experience the beginning of the high-octane Mega Man X series.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"771998268264674341a58f4fdf23e227f7b1aa51.jpg","localized_name":"Reconnaissance Complete","name":"Reconnaissance Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/743890/771998268264674341a58f4fdf23e227f7b1aa51.jpg"},{"icon":"583f73fd33cf4cbe586213d46af355b32feabf0c.jpg","localized_name":"Audio Signal Incoming","name":"Audio Signal Incoming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/743890/583f73fd33cf4cbe586213d46af355b32feabf0c.jpg"},{"icon":"5418a8e808d23ba30c5f340bdcfb23c851f3509b.jpg","localized_name":"Identity Erased","name":"Identity Erased","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/743890/5418a8e808d23ba30c5f340bdcfb23c851f3509b.jpg"},{"icon":"7632c247d0a296386f11400f0e9a641bd32207db.jpg","localized_name":"He's Actually Called Vava","name":"He's Actually Called Vava","path":"https://cdn.akama